chineseRosterCardinalityResolutionPareto : Base.InvestigativeParetoTarget
chineseRosterCardinalityResolutionPareto = Base.investigative-pareto-target
  Base.firstFront
  "Chinese roster-cardinality resolution"
  "reported lower bound -> exact source manifestation -> enumerated identities -> candidate omitted identity -> primary person/work/event weld"
  "recover the exact NewsNation source/transcript or upstream source that supports 'at least 10 scientists in China', and identify any tenth person by name before adding them to the roster"
  "NewsNation/Yahoo pays a reported lower bound of at least ten; independently enumerated reporting repeatedly names nine: Chen Shuming, Feng Yanghe, Zhou Guangyuan, Liu Donghao, Zhang Xiaoxin, Zhang Daibing, Li Minyong, Fang Daining and Yan Hong"
  "roster denominator; tenth-person identity; source genealogy; duplicate/alias detection; whether the count difference is a real omitted case, a rounding/lower-bound formulation, or source propagation"
  "NewsNation Morning in America 2026-04-24; Yahoo syndicated manifestation; nine named identities retained in ChineseStrategicScientistRosterSnowballExact"
  "person QIDs unresolved; no QID may substitute for exact tenth-name recovery"
  "070 News media / 001 Knowledge organisation traversal only"
  "original broadcast transcript/article, upstream reporting source, then primary institutional/event object for any newly identified person"
  false true false
  "First-front because one source-genealogy object can settle the nine-versus-at-least-ten discrepancy and prevent denominator error in downstream enrichment/control calculations. The count claim is retained, but no unnamed tenth identity is manufactured."

chineseStrategicScientistAcquisitionPareto : Base.InvestigativeParetoTarget
chineseStrategicScientistAcquisitionPareto = Base.investigative-pareto-target
  Base.secondFront
  "Chinese strategic scientist acquisition"
  "media roster -> primary work identity -> event/work weld -> event carrier -> technical succession -> matched-control comparison"
  "recover primary event/death carriers for Chen Shuming, Feng Yanghe, Zhou Guangyuan, Zhang Daibing, Li Minyong and Fang Daining; deepen project/publication succession for the repaired Yan Hong, Liu Donghao and Zhang Xiaoxin identities"
  "primary work is now located across all nine named rows at useful source strength; Yan Hong has exact DOI work objects and an NPU institutional work surface; event/work same-person continuity is separately repaired for Yan Hong, Liu Donghao and Zhang Xiaoxin; Fang has active-mechanical-metamaterial science and Feng has primary wargame/Bayesian/noisy-label sources"
  "remaining primary event carriers; forensic cause/manner where public; publication/project corpus; technical succession; matched-control denominator; whether strategic-field concentration survives primary reconstruction"
  "Yan DOI 10.7638/kqdlxxb-2013.0102 and 10.19527/j.cnki.2096-1642.2018.02.001; Feng ISBN 978-7-5673-0533-5 and 978-7-5673-0611-0; Zhou DOI 10.1016/j.cej.2023.147642; Zhang Daibing DOI 10.11887/j.cn.201801023, 10.13700/j.bh.1001-5965.2016.0679 and 10.13973/j.cnki.robot.2017.0160"
  "person QIDs unresolved unless independently verified"
  "006.3 AI / 519.5 Statistics / 620.11 Materials / 629 Aerospace / 005.8 Data security traversal only"
  "primary university/institute/publisher/publication objects plus primary event/death and succession carriers"
  false true false
  "Repaired identity leaves must drop from the front: Yan Hong, Liu Donghao and Zhang Xiaoxin no longer need generic same-person discovery. Their remaining debts are event-source depth, forensic specificity and succession. Cardinality uncertainty remains split into the first-front source-provenance residual."

chineseEventCauseAndSuccessionPareto : Base.InvestigativeParetoTarget
chineseEventCauseAndSuccessionPareto = Base.investigative-pareto-target
  Base.secondFront
  "Chinese event-cause and succession discriminator"
  "institutional obituary/event source -> independent event/cause carrier -> project/role succession -> matched control"
  "for repaired event/work identities, acquire any independent accident/medical/forensic source that exists and the first dated post-loss project, successor, roster or custody object; for unrepaired rows acquire event identity first"
  "Yan obituary wording says illness; Liu company obituary says accident without mechanism; Zhang Xiaoxin NSMC obituary says traffic accident; all three same-person work/event welds are paid while independent forensic causation remains unpaid"
  "separate ordinary event explanation from work-linked disruption; identify whether a project actually lost unique capability, transferred normally, or continued redundantly"
  "dates: Yan 2026-03-24 17:19; Liu 2024-03-05; Zhang Xiaoxin 2024-12-15 18:58; stable work identifiers retained in repair/work owners"
  "no QID creates cause/manner authority"
  "363.1 Safety / 620 Engineering management / domain-specific science traversal only"
  "primary police/medical/institutional event carrier where public plus dated programme/personnel/repository succession object"
  false true false
  "This lane is deliberately downstream of identity. Obituary cause wording is retained but does not equal independent forensic cause/manner; programme continuation or disruption must be acquired separately rather than inferred from death."

